This C++ program reads a sequence of integers from the standard input and processes them using a specific algorithm. The goal is to compute a cumulative sum of the first `n` elements of the array, where `n` is the number of elements read from the input. The program outputs the cumulative sum after each update operation.

### Classes and Structs

