## Overview
The `GaussianMLPRegressorModel` class is a TensorFlow-based implementation of a Gaussian Mixture Model (GMM) regressor. It extends the `GaussianMLPModel` class from the `garage.tf.models` module and is designed to perform regression tasks by fitting a Gaussian distribution to the outputs. This model allows for flexible configuration of the neural network architecture and standard deviation handling, making it suitable for various regression problems.

