- **hidden_sizes**: A list of integers specifying the number of hidden units in each hidden layer of the MLP.
- **hidden_nonlinearity**: A callable function defining the non-linearity for the hidden layers. Defaults to `tf.nn.tanh`.
- **hidden_w_init**: A callable function initializing the weights of the hidden layers. Defaults to `tf.initializers.glorot_uniform(seed=deterministic
